id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43145::$$$message_0360_0000_0000$$$::"...It's not here."::
43146::$$$message_0360_0000_0001$$$::"Eh?"::
43147::$$$message_0360_0000_0002$$$::"Not here, or here, [l][hffacechg chara=ギルガメッシュ face=哀 time=200][say storage=HKOT1_GIL_0030 _name=ギルガメッシュ]or here.[l][hffacechg chara=ギルガメッシュ face=怒2 time=200][hfangry layer=0][say storage=HKOT1_GIL_0040 _name=ギルガメッシュ] Why do I not have it!?"::
43148::$$$message_0360_0000_0003$$$::"Pipe down. What don't you have?"::
43149::$$$message_0360_0000_0004$$$::"Onsen."::
43150::$$$message_0360_0000_0005$$$::"Huh?"::
43151::$$$message_0360_0000_0006$$$::"Kotomine said that onsen are this country's treasures. I was curious, but I can't find anything resembling an onsen in my treasury."::
43152::$$$message_0360_0000_0007$$$::"...I mean, I'd be pretty surprised if you had that in there."::
43153::$$$message_0360_0000_0008$$$::"Nonsense, Lancer! My vaults contain the prototypes of every Noble Phantasm there is! Tell me why it wouldn't have a national treasure!?"::
43154::$$$message_0360_0000_0009$$$::"...You know, I've been thinking a lot about how dumb you are."::
43155::$$$message_0360_0000_0010$$$::"Again, hogwash. I'm probably so wise you can't even tell."::
43156::$$$message_0360_0000_0011$$$::"And there's no cure for that! Look, it's because bathing in onsen wasn't a thing where you grew up!"::
43157::$$$message_0360_0000_0012$$$::"Grr! And you're telling me you know what an onsen is!?"::
43158::$$$message_0360_0000_0013$$$::"...Wait. You seriously don't know?"::
43159::$$$message_0360_0000_0014$$$::"Indeed. I do not lie.[lr]::
43160::$$$message_0360_0000_0015$$$::What is it, some type of sword? Does it create hot water when you swing it?"::
43161::$$$message_0360_0000_0016$$$::"So you do have some twisted idea of it, you twat!"::
43162::$$$message_0360_0000_0017$$$::"Hm. Then why don't you go acquire one?"::
43163::$$$message_0360_0000_0018$$$::"...What are you talking about? There's no onsen around here. How is he gonna..."::
43164::$$$message_0360_0000_0019$$$::"Earlier, I received reports that the Einzberns have procured yet another Valhalla Onsen...[l][hffacechg chara=言峰 face=楽 time=200][say storage=HKOT1_KOT_0030 _name=言峰] You could go take it before anyone else does."::
43165::$$$message_0360_0000_0020$$$::"Ah, then it would be mine. Then let's go, Kotomine, Lancer!"::
43166::$$$message_0360_0000_0021$$$::"Ha! Why should I[line len=2][l][hffacechg chara=ランサー face=驚 time=200][hfangry layer=1][say storage=HKOT1_RAN_0110 _name=ランサー]LET ME GO! It's time for me to water the flowers!"::
�